 ["sent",3,"Policymakers can accelerate this transition by rewarding flexibility, for instance by paying operators who can adjust their supply quickly.",null,"Governments can speed up the change by paying those who can quickly change how much power they supply.",["Operators can accelerate policymakers by adjusting their payment.","Policymakers should reward operators who supply energy slowly.","Flexibility is rewarded when policymakers stop the transition.","Operators who pay policymakers can supply the transition quickly."],"'By rewarding flexibility' = recompensando a flexibilidade."],
